# Roots that must never appear in resource/certs/ca-bundle.pem.
#
# The embedded bundle is a static snapshot with no revocation checking (no CRL, no OCSP, no
# OneCRL/CRLSet), so a compromised CA can only be blocked by not trusting its root. Every entry here makes
# scripts/update_ca_bundle.sh (and its --check mode, run in CI) fail, even when the host's ca-certificates
# package still carries the root.
#
# Format: one SHA-256 fingerprint of the DER certificate per line (colons and case are ignored), optionally
# followed by a comment. Lines starting with # are ignored.

# GitHub issue #18: eMudhra roots removed in NSS 3.131.1 (2026-10-20). G3 issued the eight intermediates
# whose private keys were published on 2026-10-17. emSign Root CA - G1 is still in the Mozilla store.
BC:4D:80:9B:15:18:9D:78:DB:3E:1D:8C:F4:F9:72:6A:79:5D:A1:64:3C:A5:F1:35:8E:1D:DB:0E:DC:0D:7E:B3  emSign ECC Root CA - C3
86:A1:EC:BA:08:9C:4A:8D:3B:BE:27:34:C6:12:BA:34:1D:81:3E:04:3C:F9:E8:A8:62:CD:5C:57:A3:6B:BE:6B  emSign ECC Root CA - G3
12:56:09:AA:30:1D:A0:A2:49:B9:7A:82:39:CB:6A:34:21:6F:44:DC:AC:9F:39:54:B1:42:92:F2:E8:C8:60:8F  emSign Root CA - C1
